# Production build values. Committed on purpose: these are baked into the
# client bundle at build time and are all public, non-secret values.
#
# The build platform does NOT pass service env vars as Docker build args, so a
# `docker build` with no --build-arg has to get these from this file.
#
# Only browser-facing values belong here. The SSR server reads its own API URL
# from the runtime env var SSR_API_URL (see src/config/config.server.ts).
# Relative, so it is true on whatever host the platform assigns: the dashboard's
# server forwards /api-gateway/ to the API (API_PROXY_URL in bex.yaml), so the
# browser only ever talks to its own origin and the sign-in cookie needs no
# shared parent domain. Safe only because the server side never reads this
# value: SSR uses the runtime SSR_API_URL instead (src/config/config.server.ts).
VITE_API_URL=/api-gateway/
